      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1344184702,
      "text": "Terminalia prunioides, commonly known as the purple-pod cluster-leaf, purple-pod terminalia, or in Afrikaans as sterkbos or bloedvrugboom, is a small deciduous African tree in the family Combretaceae. It is native to eastern and south-central parts of the continent, ranging from Ethiopia and Somalia in the north to South Africa in the south."
